  "description": "Our Blacktop 1.0 Step Thru pairs the latest eBike technology to a tough city commuter at an affordable price point, with a fully integrated downtube battery and powerful rear drive motor. Add an optional city pack for mudguards and rear rack.\nOur all-new entry level ecommuter packs in some of the very latest eBike technologies such as a fully integrated and detachable Samsung 10.4AH battery to provide an extended range up to 60KM. The handlebar-mounted LCD information display shows usual information such as battery level, speed, trip distance and more. Also, it allows you to choose your assistance level, with 5 levels to choose from. With Shimano 7-speed gearing, confidence-inspiring city/ comfort geometry and Tektro disc brakes, the Blacktop 1.0 Step Thru is a great value eCommuter to cruise around the city effortlessly.\nAlso, the Blacktop 1.0 Step Thru is available with an optional City Pack which includes mudguards and a rear pannier rack in select countries.",
